[I] Google Noto Sans CJK fonts

[T] Noto Sans CJK is a sans serif font family from the Google Noto project
[T] covering Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese and Korean.
[T] It was developed together with Adobe, which releases the same fonts as
[T] Source Han Sans.

[U] https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk

[A] Google Inc.
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/font
[F] CROSS

[L] OFL
[V] 2.004

[D] 9a53476dfe2ce258b1c17f7d26f911ffb7b192eca1d2dcc4e45e5906 noto-cjk-sans-2.004.zip !https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk/releases/download/Sans2.004/01_NotoSansCJK-OTF-VF.zip

runmake=0
var_append zipopt ' ' -d$pkg-$ver

hook_add postmake 5 'cp -fv */OTC/*.ttc $root$datadir/fonts/'
